{"id":"planta","lemma":"planta","pos":"noun","rank":1457,"glosses":["plant (an organism of the kingdom Plantae, and now specifically, a living organism of the Embryophyta (land plants) or of the Chlorophyta (green algae), a eukaryote that includes double-membraned chloroplasts in its cells containing chlorophyll a and b, or any organism closely related to such an organism)","plant (factory)","floor, level (of a high building)"],"ipa":"/ˈplanta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"plantas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-planta.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esta planta es comestible.","en":"This plant is edible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519265"},{"text":"¿Pueden las plantas sentir dolor?","en":"Can plants feel pain?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454520"},{"text":"Esa planta necesita sombra.","en":"That plant needs shade.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523638"},{"text":"Las plantas mueren sin agua.","en":"Plants die without water.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594196"},{"text":"Se está muriendo la planta.","en":"The plant is dying.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523636"}]}